# One shield counter (CR 122.1c) on Captain America, Super-Soldier; two Dune Beetles (1/4) block him and deal their combat damage
# at the same time (CR 510.2), one damage event (CR 120.4). The counter prevents all of it and a single counter is removed, so he
# ends unmarked: were each Beetle's damage met separately, the second would be dealt and mark 1. His first strike deals 3 first,
# which does not kill a 4-toughness blocker, so both are alive to deal damage in the regular step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Captain America, Super-Soldier
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Plains
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Dune Beetle
Dune Beetle
Swamp
Swamp x20

